{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-brane-boundary","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:brane-boundary","kind":"definition","title":"Defining boundary of the brane","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-descent"],"examples":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-brane-boundary-su2"],"tags":["brane-boundary","kernel","degeneracy-locus"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Torsion.Descent.BraneBoundary","text":"brane-boundary.md","leanSource":"brane-boundary.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:brane-boundary\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a quantum observable universe equipped with the recursive brane tower <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\{A_n\\}_{n \\geq 0}</code> (<a href=\"#def:recursive-brane-tower\" data-at=\"lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation\">recursive brane tower</a>). Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{d}_{n+1}</code> be the <a class=\"refterm\" href=\"#term-descent\">descent</a> homomorphism (<a href=\"#lem:descent\"><a class=\"refterm\" href=\"#term-descent\">descent</a></a>). The <strong>defining boundary</strong> of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n</code>-th brane is the full subcategory of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}</code> comprising subobjects of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A_n</code> where the restriction morphism <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">r_n \\colon A_n \\to A_{n-1}</code> has a non-trivial kernel:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\partial A_n\n  = \n  \\bigl\\{ S \\hookrightarrow A_n \\bigm|\n    \\ker(r_n|_S) \\neq 0 \\bigr\\}.</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/brane-boundary.md","heading":"Definition","number":"6.9.3","page":"b/def-brane-boundary","qa":{"counts":{"pass":88,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":14,"unknown":0,"stale":74},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.LiftingDescent.Descent.BraneBoundary","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/brane-boundary.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
